s=\"sfn-lb\">Block Budget</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">Cost per block, per season</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"sfn-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/app/material-request\">\n      <span class=\"sfn-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(245,158,11,.13);color:#d97706\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"17\" width=\"16\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"sfn-tx\"><span class=\"sfn-lb\">Input Requests</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">Fertiliser and chemicals</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"sfn-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/app/asset?asset_category=BIOLOGICAL%20ASSETS%20(PLANTS)\">\n      <span class=\"sfn-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(245,158,11,.13);color:#d97706\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 4 13c0-6 7-9 16-9 0 9-4 15-9 16z\"/><path d=\"M4 21c3-6 7-9 11-11\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"sfn-tx\"><span class=\"sfn-lb\">Biological Assets</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">Standing crops on the books</span></span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sfn-title\">Protocol and setup</div>\n  <div class=\"sfn-grid\">\n    <a class=\"sfn-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/app/crop-protocol\">\n      <span class=\"sfn-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(100,116,139,.13);color:#64748b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 4h11a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v13H7a3 3 0 0 1-3-3z\"/><path d=\"M18 7h2v13H7\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"sfn-tx\"><span class=\"sfn-lb\">Crop Protocol</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">Weeks, yields and losses</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"sfn-tile\" data-roles=\"\" href=\"/app/crop-protocol-version\">\n      <span class=\"sfn-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(100,116,139,.13);color:#64748b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"17\" width=\"16\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"sfn-tx\"><span class=\"sfn-lb\">Protocol Versions</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">What each approval changed</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"sfn-tile\" data-roles=\"System Manager,Agriculture Manager,Farm Manager\" href=\"/app/summer-flower-grade\">\n      <span class=\"sfn-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(100,116,139,.13);color:#64748b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M5 5l2 2M17 17l2 2M19 5l-2 2M7 17l-2 2\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"sfn-tx\"><span class=\"sfn-lb\">Grades</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">Grades and stem counts</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"sfn-tile\" data-roles=\"System Manager,Agriculture Manager\" href=\"/app/summer-flower-settings\">\n      <span class=\"sfn-ic\" style=\"background:rgba(100,116,139,.13);color:#64748b\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.9l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-2.9 1.2V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 7 19.4a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.9.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.2-2.9H1a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.1A1.7 1.7 0 0 0 2.6 7\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"sfn-tx\"><span class=\"sfn-lb\">Settings</span><span class=\"sfn-sub\">Module-wide defaults</span></span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
